{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg3NZYDtkY6RFtdFC7A56","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I resolved the merge and committed it as `252a346`. One check still fails: core's size limit, which was already over on the base branch before this merge.\n\n**The conflict:** the only conflict marker was in `test/index.ts`, where both branches had added adoption tests after the same test. I kept both sets:\n- **This ticket's tests:** the `quietly` helper and the two `raw()` tests, one for a button after a multi-node `raw()` and one for a bound attribute after a text-and-element `raw()`.\n- **The base's tests:** `attrWrites` and the passive adoption tests (static attributes, bound attributes that match or differ, and the iframe that must not reload).\n\nGit merged `AGENTS.md` and `src/htm.browser.ts` cleanly. Both sides' additions are present.\n\n**Browser templater size:** the base's passive adoption code plus this ticket's `raw()` change brings it to 4.68 kB, over the base's 4.65 kB limit. The ticket says to round the measured size up to the next 0.05 kB, so I set the limit in `.size-limit.js` to 4.7 kB and added a note to ADR-007.\n\n**Checks:** build, typecheck and lint pass, `npm run test:ssr` passes 98/98 and `npm test` passes 361/361. `npm run size` passes except for core.\n\n**Core size, not fixed:** `npm run size` fails because core is 4.24 kB against its 4.2 kB limit. This merge didn't cause it: the merged core source is identical to the base's, and I built the base on its own and size-limit measured the same 4.24 kB. This ticket doesn't touch core, so I left the core limit alone. The spec sets core's budget in the later restructure ticket. Until then, either someone raises the limit on the base branch or someone trims the extra 42 bytes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":633,"cache_read_input_tokens":68122,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":633},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f36234a9-39f9-42b6-adfe-69bb0c6f7c55","uuid":"e29490e2-fea9-4606-97d6-8ce86660fa2b","timestamp":"2026-10-15T04:13:55.081Z","request_id":"req_011Cg3NZXvJ1FR9Qa351nDvN"}
